    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McMorrow Properties are delighted to bring to the market this 1 bed first floor apartment located in this elegant period property on this lovely quiet residential road in Dun Laoghaire. The apartment has been finished to a high standard and offers excellent accommodation. Located close to the Peoples Park, the Seafront of Dun Laoghaire, shops, schools and public transport, with the Sandycove and Glasthule DART station just a short walk away. Ideally situated just off Lower Georges Street, the property benefits from every conceivable amenity within walking distance, including cafés, restaurants, boutique shops, leisure and sports facilities and excellent transport links. Clarinda Tennis Club is directly across the road, while the seafront, Dun Laoghaire Pier and the Forty Foot are just a short stroll away. The apartment further benefits from an individual locked storage room at basement level. There is private parking to the rear for residents."
      },
      {
